<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακῑν-έω</span></b>  (once <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άω,</span> imper. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακείνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHolm.</u>
					20.19
				</span></i>
			), <i>sway</i> or <i>swing to and fro,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.94
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>stir up, awaken,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1259
				</span></i>
			; of cocks or quails, <i>stir</i> them <i>up</i> (to
			fight), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				789c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολείμματαστάσεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαι ἀνακεκίνηνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					85c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pherecyd.
				102
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>uproot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς κρηπῖδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Agath.
					2.1
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καθεστῶτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.27
				</span></i>
			.</div>
